<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Vital Controller Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  td, th { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <header style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">ABB JOKAB SAFETY Products</div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 14px;">
      <span data-field="document_date">{{ document_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </header>
  <h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">Vital Controller</h1>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Inspired by industry standards</h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6;">The Vital Controller was developed to address the shortcomings of safety relay technology, reduce the need for multiple safety relays, and offer an enhanced level of safety that conventional safety relays cannot. Using our proprietary dynamic pulse technology, Vital can accommodate up to <span data-field="max_safety_devices">{{ max_safety_devices }}</span> safety devices, detect faults at the time of occurrence, and meet the highest level of safety.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Unparalleled value</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
      <li><span data-field="value_point_1">{{ value_point_1 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_2">{{ value_point_2 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_3">{{ value_point_3 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_4">{{ value_point_4 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_5">{{ value_point_5 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_6">{{ value_point_6 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_7">Up to <span data-field="percentage_reduction">{{ value_point_7">Up to <span data-field= }}</span> less components needed to achieve the higher levels of safety.</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_8">{{ value_point_8 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="value_point_9">{{ value_point_9 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Increase profits by reducing downtime</h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6;">LEDs, standard on every Vital, makes set up and troubleshooting quick and easy, unlike conventional systems without any visual indication. Without this feature, common system faults—due to vibration, misalignment and single channel safety faults—can be a mystery to diagnose until safety devices are individually cycled and tested, resulting in extended downtime.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_1.png" alt="Vital Controller Diagram" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_image_2.png" alt="Vital Controller Diagram" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">VITAL DIAGNOSTICS! LED allows for immediate diagnosis and reset.</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">Green LED: Door closed = device closed and entire circuit up to this point is satisfied. Red LED: Door opened = device opened or door out of alignment. Flashing Green/Red LED: Door closed, but door located before it is open.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="font-size: 14px;">
      <span data-field="page_number">{{ page_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 14px;">
      <span data-field="document_date_2">{{ document_date_2 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Increase machine reliability and safety with Vital controller</h2>
    <p style="line-height: 1.6;">When designing control reliable circuits, the drawbacks of safety relay technology limit the number of safety devices that can be utilized in a circuit. Dual channel safety relays can, under certain conditions, allow for a fault to go undetected. The example below shows a simple safety relay circuit, using three mechanical interlock switches wired in series to safety relay. A short occurs between two doors. The safety relay does not detect the fault until a door is opened. However, if a door earlier in the circuit is cycled or the systems restarted, the fault will be cleared but the short will still exist. The machine can then be restarted.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">With a safety relay solution, a short across one of the channels can occur and will not be detected by the safety relay.</h3>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_1.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 1" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">The fault is undetected.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_2.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 2" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">Machine stops.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Any of the doors before the short can be opened and will stop the machine. The safety relay will see both channels change state.</h3>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_3.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 3" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">The fault is undetected.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_4.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 4" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">Machine stops.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Door 2 or Door 3 can now be closed and the safety relay can be reset.</h3>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_5.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 5" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">The fault is undetected.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_6.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 6" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">Machine stops.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">When Door 1 is opened the safety relay will now enter a single channel fault and does not allow for a simple reset.</h3>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_7.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 7" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">Now the troubleshooting begins...</p>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_diagram_8.png" alt="Safety Relay Diagram 8" style="max-width: 30%;">
        <p style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 5px;">Machine stops.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Troubleshooting techniques for safety relay technology</h2>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px;">
      <li><span data-field="troubleshooting_tip_1">{{ troubleshooting_tip_1 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="troubleshooting_tip_2">{{ troubleshooting_tip_2 }}</span></li>
      <li><span data-field="troubleshooting_tip_3">{{ troubleshooting_tip_3 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="text-align: left;">
      <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_abb_logo.png" alt="ABB Logo" style="height: 40px;">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <p style="font-size: 14px;">
      <span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="address_line_2">{{ address_line_2 }}</span><br>
      <span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span><br>
      Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span><br>
      Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span><br>
      Web: <span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
    <div style="font-size: 14px;">
      Power and productivity<br>
      for a better world™
    </div>
    <img src="placeholder_abb_logo_bottom.png" alt="ABB Logo" style="height: 40px;">
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>